{"ticker":"RMD","updated":"2026-11-07T01:51:16Z","profile":{"longName":"ResMed Inc.","shortName":"ResMed Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.resmed.com","fullTimeEmployees":11370,"marketCap":33096609792,"trailingPE":21.429874,"forwardPE":17.790298,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.7733274,"pegRatio":1.28,"targetMeanPrice":264.33472,"targetHighPrice":320.0,"targetLowPrice":210.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.059,"earningsGrowth":0.232,"grossMargins":0.6177,"operatingMargins":0.3482,"profitMargins":0.27791,"totalRevenue":5732675072,"beta":0.763,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":277.67,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":180.27,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.1},"summary":"ResMed Inc. engages in the digital health and cloud-connected medical devices business in the United States and internationally. It operates in two segments, Sleep and Breathing Health, and Residential Care Software. The company offers sleep recorders for the diagnosis and titration of sleep apnea in sleep clinics, hospitals, and at home, including ApneaLink Air, a portable diagnostic device that measures oximetry, respiratory effort, pulse, nasal flow, and snoring; NightOwl, a portable, cloud-connected, and disposable diagnostic device that measures AHI based on derived peripheral arterial tone, actigraphy, and oximetry; and EasyCare Tx, a sleep lab solution. It also provides AirView, a cloud-based system that enables remote monitoring and changing of patients' device settings; myAir, a personalized therapy management application for patients with sleep apnea that provides support, education, and troubleshooting tools for increased patient engagement and improved compliance; and connectivity module which provides a cellular connection between compatible ventilation devices and AirView system. In addition, the company offers Brightree solutions which are solutions and services for organizations in home medical equipment and pharmacy, orthotic and prosthetic, and home infusion; HEALTHCAREfirst solutions that offers electronic health record, software, billing and coding services,","summary_zh":"ResMed Inc. 在美國和國際上從事數位健康和​​雲端連接醫療設備業務。它分為兩個部分：睡眠和呼吸健康部分以及住宅護理軟體部分。該公司提供用於睡眠診所、醫院和家庭診斷和滴定睡眠呼吸中止症的睡眠記錄儀，包括 ApneaLink Air，一種便攜式診斷設備，可測量血氧飽和度、呼吸努力、脈搏、鼻流量和打鼾； NightOwl，一種便攜式、雲連接的一次性診斷設備，可根據衍生的外周動脈張力、體動實驗室記錄和血氧測定法測量 AHI；它還提供AirView，這是一個基於雲端的系統，可以遠端監控和更改患者的設備設定； myAir，一個針對睡眠呼吸中止症患者的個人化治療管理應用程序，可提供支援、教育和故障排除工具，以提高患者參與度並提高依從性；連接模組提供相容通風設備和 AirView 系統之間的蜂窩連接。此外，該公司還提供 Brightree 解決方案，為家庭醫療設備和製藥、矯形器和義肢以及家庭輸液等領域的組織提供解決方案和服務； HEALTHCAREfirst 解決方案提供電子健康記錄、軟體、計費和編碼服務，","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":276.47,"h":279.73,"l":273.37,"c":279.46,"v":688500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":280.25,"h":281.32,"l":278.66,"c":279.19,"v":613500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":278.3,"h":279.67,"l":265.68,"c":270.47,"v":1093800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":271.33,"h":275.35,"l":270.42,"c":274.61,"v":727300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":273.15,"h":273.56,"l":269.0,"c":270.14,"v":1257700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":271.0,"h":273.41,"l":271.0,"c":271.19,"v":940900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":270.42,"h":273.7,"l":270.08,"c":272.6,"v":840800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":274.51,"h":275.75,"l":270.02,"c":271.71,"v":847500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":273.42,"h":273.79,"l":270.49,"c":273.29,"v":552900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":272.92,"h":274.02,"l":271.32,"c":273.19,"v":1536200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":272.4,"h":275.53,"l":270.6,"c":274.41,"v":549200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":273.53,"h":277.1,"l":273.26,"c":275.61,"v":771800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":275.08,"h":277.43,"l":273.11,"c":274.19,"v":692800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":268.66,"h":268.89,"l":264.14,"c":267.31,"v":881400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":269.21,"h":271.66,"l":267.4,"c":270.27,"v":755000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":271.1,"h":271.98,"l":268.07,"c":271.05,"v":977700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":271.01,"h":275.7,"l":270.74,"c":273.73,"v":1174100},{"t":"2